:: StoryTitle
The Last Approach

:: StoryInit
<<cacheaudio "intro1" "sources/Assets/Intro/Intro1.ogg">>

:: Start
<<nobr>>
    <video id="bg-video" autoplay loop muted playsinline>
      <source src="sources/Assets/Intro/Intro1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <<audio "intro1" play loop>>
    <div class="titleParent">
        <p class="titleTop">Welcome to</p>
        <p class="titleBottom">The Last Approach</p>

    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Begin the journey->tutorial]]
        </div>
    </div>

<</nobr>>

:: tutorial

<<nobr>>

    <video id="bg-video" autoplay loop muted playsinline>
      <source src="sources\Assets\Ch1\Video2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>

    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter 0 - Tutorial</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>In this game, you play by selecting different pathways (Using the buttons on the top). In the end, these decisions will lead to an outcome. To make the game more interesting, there are no redoes, and whatever you pick, is final, and you have to live with it.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Understood->Chapter1Intro]]
        </div>
    </div>

<</nobr>>
